{
    "name": "agent",
    "type": "class",
    "description": "An agent an app declares, projected into a record.\nThe file owns what it says: this record is rebuilt from it and never written\nback to it. The declaration is named by its own identity — `<uuid>.yml` — so\nthe record takes that uuid, an agent renamed or moved stays the same agent,\nand a declaration that is gone leaves no record behind.",
